OL,3,ADaughter of MP murdered five years ago
OL,4,Atells BBC politicians still at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe daughter of murdered MP Sir David
OL,7,FAmess says politicians are still at
OL,8,Frisk and questioned if anything has
OL,9,Fchanged five years after her father's
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FKatie Amess told the BBC's Sunday with
OL,13,FLaura Kuenssberg what happened to her
OL,14,Ffather "wasn't an isolated incident, we
OL,15,Fare seeing increased threats towards
OL,16,Fmembers of parliament".
OL,18,FSir David was the Conservative MP for
OL,19,FSouthend West when he was stabbed
OL,20,Fmultiple times while holding a
OL,21,Fconstituency surgery in Leigh-on-Sea,
OL,22,FEssex, in October 2021.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
